#. <CLT 4>…自分自身に言葉をぶつけたって、
#. みんなを説得できるわけじゃない…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can keep repeating things to myself over and over,\n"
"but I need to find the words to convince *them*!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>自分自身の…言葉…？
#. ………………！！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Convince...them...?\n"
"...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0003 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>何か…何かあるはずだ…！
#. みんなを説得できる言葉が！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something... There has to be something I can say to\n"
"persuade everyone...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0005 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>何か…何かあるはずだ…！
#. みんなを説得できる言葉が！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something... There has to be something I can say to\n"
"persuade everyone...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0007 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>何か…何かあるはずだ…！
#. みんなを説得できる言葉が！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something... There has to be something I can say to\n"
"persuade everyone...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0009 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>何か…何かあるはずだ…！
#. みんなを説得できる言葉が！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Something... There has to be something I can say to\n"
"persuade everyone...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0011 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. <CLT 4>あとは霧切さんだけ…！
#. ボクの中の希望を…彼女に伝えるんだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Kyoko's the only one left... I have to help her find\n"
"the same hope I have inside of me!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. お、俺の占いだと、
#. やっぱ…ここから出ない方が…
msgctxt "0013 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"All my fortune-telling senses are telling me not to\n"
"leave this place..."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0014 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. うぉぉぉおおおおッ！！
msgctxt "0015 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "Ngaaaaaahh!"
msgstr ""

#. でも、生きる事って、
#. 前に進む事だよな？
msgctxt "0016 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "But to live means moving forward, right...?"
msgstr ""

#. 辛くても…怖くても…前に進む事だよな…？
msgctxt "0017 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"So even if it's hard...even if we're scared...we don't\n"
"have any choice, do we?"
msgstr ""

#. 俺はまだ生きたいべ！　次の扉を開きたいべ！
#. 新しい何かが待ってるはずだって！
msgctxt "0018 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"I want to keep on living! I want to open the next\n"
"door! There must be something new waiting for me!"
msgstr ""

#. だから…だから…
msgctxt "0019 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "So that's why... That's why...!"
msgstr ""

#. やっぱここから出たいべ！
msgctxt "0020 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid "No matter what, I need to get out of here!"
msgstr ""

#. もう、占いなんてどうでもいい！
#. 俺は俺の直感を信じる事にしたんだ！！
msgctxt "0021 | YASUHIRO HAGAKURE"
msgid ""
"The whole fortune-telling thing doesn't matter\n"
"anymore! What matters is my own gut feelings!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0022 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ちょっと…考えてみたんだ…
msgctxt "0023 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "I've been thinking about all this..."
msgstr ""

#. こんな時…さくらちゃんなら、
#. なんて言うのかなって…
msgctxt "0024 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"And I was thinking...at a time like this, what would\n"
"Sakura do?"
msgstr ""

#. 強さは困難に立ち向かう事でしか掴めん！
#. ならば、我はあえて茨の道を進もう！！
msgctxt "0025 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid ""
"You only get stronger by taking adversity by the\n"
"horns! Confront that thorny path with enthusiasm!"
msgstr ""

#. …とか言いそうじゃない？
msgctxt "0026 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "That sounds like something she'd say, right?"
msgstr ""

#. て言うか…絶対に言うと思うんだよね…
msgctxt "0027 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "No, I think that's definitely what she'd say!"
msgstr ""

#. だから…私は……
msgctxt "0028 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Which is why I...I...!"
msgstr ""

#. うんっ、決めたよ！！
msgctxt "0029 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Yeah! I've made up my mind!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0030 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0031 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Kyeeehahahaha!"
msgstr "Kyeeehahahaha!"

#. アタシ的にどっちでもよし！
#. 単純に、楽しそうな方を選びまーす！
msgctxt "0032 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"I don't care either way! I'm fine with whichever one\n"
"is more interesting!"
msgstr ""

#. 実は、こう見えてさ、
#. 昔から学校が嫌いなんだよね！
msgctxt "0033 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Actually, I may not look like it, but I've always\n"
"hated school!"
msgstr ""

#. いやいや…どう見えてだっつーの！！
#. ゲラゲラゲラゲラッ！！
msgctxt "0034 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Hell, no matter how I look! Still hate it!\n"
"Kyeeehahahaha!"
msgstr ""

#. あ、だけど…
#. 白夜様が来るのは最低条件だから！
msgctxt "0035 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid ""
"Oh, but...no matter what, Master has to come along\n"
"with us!"
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0036 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. どうした…？
msgctxt "0037 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "What's the matter?"
msgstr ""

#. まさか、お前如きが俺を励まそうなどと、
#. 考えてるんじゃないだろうな…
msgctxt "0038 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You're not actually trying to encourage me, are you?"
msgstr ""

#. フン…バカバカしい…
msgctxt "0039 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "Hmph. Ridiculous."
msgstr ""

#. 俺は最初から…絶望なんぞに屈するつもりはない…
msgctxt "0040 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"It never even crossed my mind that I might give in to\n"
"despair."
msgstr ""

#. だが、勘違いするなよ。
#. お前がどうなろうと知った事ではない。
msgctxt "0041 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"But don't misunderstand me. I couldn't care in the\n"
"slightest what happens to you."
msgstr ""

#. 俺は、ただ自分の言葉を守るだけだ。
#. 黒幕を殺すという言葉をな…
msgctxt "0042 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"I just have to keep my word. I swore I would end the\n"
"life of the mastermind."
msgstr ""

#. それに…我が十神家は滅んでなどいない…
#. まだ、この俺が残っている。
msgctxt "0043 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"Besides, the Togami family *isn't* dead. Because I'm\n"
"still alive..."
msgstr ""

#. ならば、俺の力で十神家を再建させるまでだ。
#. 今まで以上の存在としてな…！
msgctxt "0044 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid ""
"So until I can restore the Togami family, and bring it\n"
"greater glory than it's ever known...!"
msgstr ""

#. もはや希望は外にはないんだよ。
#. 絶望こそがオマエラの寝床…
msgctxt "0045 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid ""
"There is no hope left in the world. When you sleep,\n"
"it's on a bed of despair..."
msgstr ""

#. 絶望しなよ…世界に…自分に…
msgctxt "0046 | JUNKO ENOSHIMA (REAL)"
msgid "The world is in despair. *You* are in despair."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>このままじゃ絶望が…
#. みんなの心に根ざしていく…！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0047 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I don't do something, everyone's gonna be consumed\n"
"by despair...!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>外に希望が無いって言うのなら…
#. 絶望が伝染するって言うのなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0048 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You claim there's no hope left in the world. But if\n"
"despair is contagious like you say...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>ボクの中の希望<CLT><CLT 4>をみんなに…ッ！
#. 希望の種だって、みんなの中にあるはずなんだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0049 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then so is hope! I'll use <CLT><CLT 3>my own hope<CLT><CLT 4> to plant\n"
"seeds of hope inside everyone else!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>外に希望が無いって言うのなら…
#. 絶望が伝染するって言うのなら…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0050 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>You claim there's no hope left in the world. But if\n"
"despair is contagious like you say...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4><CLT><CLT 3>ボクの中の希望<CLT><CLT 4>をみんなに…ッ！
#. 希望の種だって、みんなの中にあるはずなんだ！
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0051 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>...then so is hope! I'll use <CLT><CLT 3>my own hope<CLT><CLT 4> to plant\n"
"seeds of hope inside everyone else!\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
